  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="bb944852-cd62-5ecf-b106-ff047da43685" activityNameId="2bf083b2-14c3-5972-8b67-9e23d417f637" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Long-distance train</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Long-distance train
The exchanges of the train manufacturing are derived from an assessment of the "IC 2000", a long-distance train which is currently used for long distance transportation in Switzerland .The life span of the train  is assumed to be 40 years resulting in a life time performance of  20’000’000 vkm. The dominating material is alluminium to reduce the weight and hence energy consumption in operation.;
UUID: 7bc9ba5f-0268-383b-972c-b7943329e993
This inventory calls processes of material production, representing the material composition of a standard Swiss Long-Distance Train (IC 2000) For manufacturing, electricity and light oil burned in industrial furnace are included. For the transportation of materials standard distance are applied.
Location: Manufacturing data represents a train produced in Europe.
Technology: In 2000 the modelled train represents the state of the art of long distance transport in Switzerland.  In the near future the share of this train type on the total long distance transport will be increased. 
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: The data of the material composition and energy consumption is based on  literature studies. 
Extrapolations: This train type is used as an estimate for the entire long-distance train fleet.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7bc9ba5f-0268-383b-972c-b7943329e993.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
